{"3431600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Supreme Heroes", "steam_appid": 3431600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Hack &amp; Slash melee combat with Item/weapon crafting and a Skills/progression system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden loot &amp; investigation with Inventory viewing, lore history, &amp; quick selection. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Map system complete with Quick Saving, Vehicular Travel, and some Flight. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Settings customization and Full Ultra Widescreen support!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreal Engine 5 GASP Integration</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/ad11f51a387ad9bb116661201e4f80cb.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supreme Heroes</strong> is a Cytro-Epic <strong>Fantasy-Adventure ARPG</strong>, inspired by the likes of the <i>Kingdom Hearts</i>, Devil May Cry,<i> </i>and<i> STAR WARS Jedi </i>series<i>, </i>and it follows the life of Jacob Matthew Caullen.<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/6c5988cb845882cba1550c50b8e2f27a.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/6c5988cb845882cba1550c50b8e2f27a.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/6c5988cb845882cba1550c50b8e2f27a.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the modern-fantasy metropolis of <i>Some City</i>, California, Jake  awakens his supernatural powers just weeks away from his sixteenth birthday. It's rare enough to manifest one supernatural ability, let alone three!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jake is still learning who he is and what kind of legend he will become, according to prophecies. Five immortals known  as the Select Few, who have been watching over Jake, eventually interrupt his mediocre life and bring him to their realm when they feel they have found their chosen one, and they begin to pass onto him the mantle and responsibilities of protecting humanity so that he can fulfill his destiny and become the next <strong>Cytro,</strong> alongside a new potentially legendary team that he gets to handpick. Of course Jake chooses his four best friends almost immediately, but leading them—encouraging them to embrace their untapped supernatural power, remain united in the face of  worldly tensions, and accept the mantle of saving the world—is all but easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having survived Earth's most historic wars, the retiring Select Few will guide Jake and his new team &quot;The <i>Elect</i> Few&quot; to continue protecting mankind. Perilous events soon force the Elect Few to battle a cursed villain who can't seem to stay defeated, in order to save the city and together become <strong>Supreme Heroes</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But plans don't always go as intended...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/53c570b07d68b18f27e297eb18fd460c.avif?t=1788199434\" width=500 height=642 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/5aa4e5023b62080408b9114c9e20c7d1.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The glory of <strong>Supreme Heroes</strong>'s mechanics is in getting to experience a <strong>Hack-n-Slash Sword Fantasy</strong> <strong>coming of age</strong> story in a timeline much like our own. Enemies will be using swords <i>and</i> guns while you, <i>as teens</i>, mostly  have access to just swords, but <i>all</i> your weapons eventually grant you access to <strong>Magic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/76002583865c84e3f5ae464029835c37.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/76002583865c84e3f5ae464029835c37.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/76002583865c84e3f5ae464029835c37.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to cast your <strong>Magic</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Short Spells</i>, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mid Spells</i>,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>or Long Spells</i>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Empyrean Blade you  equip changes the element of the Spell and grants you an immense array of stats... from swing styles and combos,  to elemental magic  and defensive abilities... from unique names and histories, to the tremendous enchantment of your armor, allowing you to don a new &quot;<strong>Form</strong>&quot;, channel the spirit of the blade's previous owner on the fly, and  chain together nigh unstoppable combos against your adaptive foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/a7e2b089b502d264c625027ce7b3e2f3.avif?t=1788199434\" width=500 height=642 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/9118b7860ec48483e3c7f45b11c26c51.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover or <strong>Craft</strong> your arsenal and become a <strong>Supreme Hero</strong> as you face off against villains from your dreams and in your hometown, a city and desert filled with hidden loot and rare treasures! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting<strong> </strong>allows you to forge your Empyrean swords, hammer, spears, axes, and daggers from recovered minerals for quick access from your inventory, especially during story beats  where weapon access is normally restricted. You can also trade obtained  minerals with vendors to help you craft the exact Empyrean blade you're looking for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4ba12618f809441f6d8dc4e012eb588b.avif?t=1788199434\" width=500 height=642 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/380da33c89de20ee502e81cf0dac34f3.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/380da33c89de20ee502e81cf0dac34f3.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/380da33c89de20ee502e81cf0dac34f3.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/a0d0b127f2033b19f16fef377ef3b4c7.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 ways you can access your arsenal:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><u>Stats Menu</u></strong> shows you your own stats as well as every weapon you can eventually have and each weapon's power level with a brief description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><u>Hot Bar</u> </strong>is a persistent and customizable menu that lets you move or replace  up to 4 crafted items  from your Inventory! Drop items at will and pick them up again to automatically populate the Hot Bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, drop, and select any of your collected Elemental <i>UNCOMMON</i>,<i> RARE, and LEGENDARY </i>weapons in the <strong><u>Inventory Menu</u></strong>. You can even combine certain minerals with some weapons to increase their efficiency and cut their weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or quickly swap between all uniquely enchanted weapons across all 6 Weapon Classes (<i>COMMON, UNCOMMON, RARE, EPIC, ELECT FEW, &amp; LEGENDARY</i>) with the <strong><u>Quick Pack</u></strong>! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4953ac834701ec10787923c8f841528e.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4953ac834701ec10787923c8f841528e.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4953ac834701ec10787923c8f841528e.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/0172004152ca13b441a257b94d50c061.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/0172004152ca13b441a257b94d50c061.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/0172004152ca13b441a257b94d50c061.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/ee79983b249afd0b46d265621d6133b9.avif?t=1788199434\" width=500 height=642 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/8c4321a258213676be716a7dba6ea385.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly spot nearby hidden treasures, more loot for crafting, and lurking enemies for XP  with your handy <strong>Mini Map</strong>. And don't forget to take the scenic route with your trusty <strong>Cytron Motorcycle. </strong>When you're ready, travel beyond Some City, from the constantly rainy and dreary streets of <i>New Los Angeles</i> to the dazzling streets of <i>Neo Paris</i>. From the sand-swept deserts of the <i>Middle East</i> to the perilous mountain base of <i>North Korea</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liberate</strong> the world from your foes to level up as soon as you can! Scattered lore and triggered <strong> Events</strong> or <strong>Ambushes</strong> will populate your <strong>Database</strong> with  info about your items and enemies. Only then can you unlock more skills and <strong>Fly</strong> across rooftops or <strong>Wall-Run</strong>  up skyscrapers, ultimately becoming the <strong>Supreme Hero</strong> this planet deserves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/94a71178f7d8c6712bf05ee9fc288204.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/94a71178f7d8c6712bf05ee9fc288204.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/94a71178f7d8c6712bf05ee9fc288204.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/1f88bb1148c68c3b21678a3b1121e234.avif?t=1788199434\" width=500 height=642 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/ca91b2c8efa7eafc43b807ef51dbe282.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/9ce15ceeef8c1c46c046e3ed8216f1b1.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn the way of the Heroes by retrieving and retaining <strong>Orbs</strong>, your  source of strength.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbs. Are. Everything! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Be mindful of your <strong>Orb Gauge</strong> <i>(Mana)</i> and your <strong>Orb Vitality</strong> <i>(Health)</i>. Should your opponent deal damage to you, you'll lose Orbs from both your Orb Vitality <i>and</i> your Orb Gauge, robbing you of your very essence and temporarily preventing you from using Magic, Blocking, and Sprints. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also gain or lose Orbs depending on the public's perception of you, in a similar fashion to Karma, so don't go slicing too many light posts and trees in half! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve dropped Orbs and Orblettes to maintain vitality and, more importantly,  to unlock new <strong>Advances</strong> <i>(Skills)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between your massive arsenal, your expert crafting, and your super abilities, you should be well-equipped for the world of battle that lies ahead, <i>hero</i>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/7e4af0d7eadac5afa121296ee4e560f9.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/7e4af0d7eadac5afa121296ee4e560f9.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/7e4af0d7eadac5afa121296ee4e560f9.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/ad11f51a387ad9bb116661201e4f80cb.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supreme Heroes</strong> is a Cytro-Epic <strong>Fantasy-Adventure ARPG</strong>, inspired by the likes of the <i>Kingdom Hearts</i>, Devil May Cry,<i> </i>and<i> STAR WARS Jedi </i>series<i>, </i>and it follows the life of Jacob Matthew Caullen.<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/6c5988cb845882cba1550c50b8e2f27a.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/6c5988cb845882cba1550c50b8e2f27a.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/6c5988cb845882cba1550c50b8e2f27a.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the modern-fantasy metropolis of <i>Some City</i>, California, Jake  awakens his supernatural powers just weeks away from his sixteenth birthday. It's rare enough to manifest one supernatural ability, let alone three!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jake is still learning who he is and what kind of legend he will become, according to prophecies. Five immortals known  as the Select Few, who have been watching over Jake, eventually interrupt his mediocre life and bring him to their realm when they feel they have found their chosen one, and they begin to pass onto him the mantle and responsibilities of protecting humanity so that he can fulfill his destiny and become the next <strong>Cytro,</strong> alongside a new potentially legendary team that he gets to handpick. Of course Jake chooses his four best friends almost immediately, but leading them—encouraging them to embrace their untapped supernatural power, remain united in the face of  worldly tensions, and accept the mantle of saving the world—is all but easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having survived Earth's most historic wars, the retiring Select Few will guide Jake and his new team &quot;The <i>Elect</i> Few&quot; to continue protecting mankind. Perilous events soon force the Elect Few to battle a cursed villain who can't seem to stay defeated, in order to save the city and together become <strong>Supreme Heroes</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But plans don't always go as intended...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/53c570b07d68b18f27e297eb18fd460c.avif?t=1788199434\" width=500 height=642 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/5aa4e5023b62080408b9114c9e20c7d1.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The glory of <strong>Supreme Heroes</strong>'s mechanics is in getting to experience a <strong>Hack-n-Slash Sword Fantasy</strong> <strong>coming of age</strong> story in a timeline much like our own. Enemies will be using swords <i>and</i> guns while you, <i>as teens</i>, mostly  have access to just swords, but <i>all</i> your weapons eventually grant you access to <strong>Magic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/76002583865c84e3f5ae464029835c37.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/76002583865c84e3f5ae464029835c37.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/76002583865c84e3f5ae464029835c37.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to cast your <strong>Magic</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Short Spells</i>, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mid Spells</i>,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>or Long Spells</i>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Empyrean Blade you  equip changes the element of the Spell and grants you an immense array of stats... from swing styles and combos,  to elemental magic  and defensive abilities... from unique names and histories, to the tremendous enchantment of your armor, allowing you to don a new &quot;<strong>Form</strong>&quot;, channel the spirit of the blade's previous owner on the fly, and  chain together nigh unstoppable combos against your adaptive foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/a7e2b089b502d264c625027ce7b3e2f3.avif?t=1788199434\" width=500 height=642 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/9118b7860ec48483e3c7f45b11c26c51.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover or <strong>Craft</strong> your arsenal and become a <strong>Supreme Hero</strong> as you face off against villains from your dreams and in your hometown, a city and desert filled with hidden loot and rare treasures! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting<strong> </strong>allows you to forge your Empyrean swords, hammer, spears, axes, and daggers from recovered minerals for quick access from your inventory, especially during story beats  where weapon access is normally restricted. You can also trade obtained  minerals with vendors to help you craft the exact Empyrean blade you're looking for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4ba12618f809441f6d8dc4e012eb588b.avif?t=1788199434\" width=500 height=642 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/380da33c89de20ee502e81cf0dac34f3.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/380da33c89de20ee502e81cf0dac34f3.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/380da33c89de20ee502e81cf0dac34f3.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/a0d0b127f2033b19f16fef377ef3b4c7.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 ways you can access your arsenal:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><u>Stats Menu</u></strong> shows you your own stats as well as every weapon you can eventually have and each weapon's power level with a brief description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><u>Hot Bar</u> </strong>is a persistent and customizable menu that lets you move or replace  up to 4 crafted items  from your Inventory! Drop items at will and pick them up again to automatically populate the Hot Bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, drop, and select any of your collected Elemental <i>UNCOMMON</i>,<i> RARE, and LEGENDARY </i>weapons in the <strong><u>Inventory Menu</u></strong>. You can even combine certain minerals with some weapons to increase their efficiency and cut their weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or quickly swap between all uniquely enchanted weapons across all 6 Weapon Classes (<i>COMMON, UNCOMMON, RARE, EPIC, ELECT FEW, &amp; LEGENDARY</i>) with the <strong><u>Quick Pack</u></strong>! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4953ac834701ec10787923c8f841528e.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4953ac834701ec10787923c8f841528e.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/4953ac834701ec10787923c8f841528e.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/0172004152ca13b441a257b94d50c061.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/0172004152ca13b441a257b94d50c061.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/0172004152ca13b441a257b94d50c061.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/ee79983b249afd0b46d265621d6133b9.avif?t=1788199434\" width=500 height=642 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/8c4321a258213676be716a7dba6ea385.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly spot nearby hidden treasures, more loot for crafting, and lurking enemies for XP  with your handy <strong>Mini Map</strong>. And don't forget to take the scenic route with your trusty <strong>Cytron Motorcycle. </strong>When you're ready, travel beyond Some City, from the constantly rainy and dreary streets of <i>New Los Angeles</i> to the dazzling streets of <i>Neo Paris</i>. From the sand-swept deserts of the <i>Middle East</i> to the perilous mountain base of <i>North Korea</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liberate</strong> the world from your foes to level up as soon as you can! Scattered lore and triggered <strong> Events</strong> or <strong>Ambushes</strong> will populate your <strong>Database</strong> with  info about your items and enemies. Only then can you unlock more skills and <strong>Fly</strong> across rooftops or <strong>Wall-Run</strong>  up skyscrapers, ultimately becoming the <strong>Supreme Hero</strong> this planet deserves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/94a71178f7d8c6712bf05ee9fc288204.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/94a71178f7d8c6712bf05ee9fc288204.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/94a71178f7d8c6712bf05ee9fc288204.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/1f88bb1148c68c3b21678a3b1121e234.avif?t=1788199434\" width=500 height=642 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/ca91b2c8efa7eafc43b807ef51dbe282.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1024 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/9ce15ceeef8c1c46c046e3ed8216f1b1.avif?t=1788199434\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn the way of the Heroes by retrieving and retaining <strong>Orbs</strong>, your  source of strength.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbs. Are. Everything! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Be mindful of your <strong>Orb Gauge</strong> <i>(Mana)</i> and your <strong>Orb Vitality</strong> <i>(Health)</i>. Should your opponent deal damage to you, you'll lose Orbs from both your Orb Vitality <i>and</i> your Orb Gauge, robbing you of your very essence and temporarily preventing you from using Magic, Blocking, and Sprints. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also gain or lose Orbs depending on the public's perception of you, in a similar fashion to Karma, so don't go slicing too many light posts and trees in half! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve dropped Orbs and Orblettes to maintain vitality and, more importantly,  to unlock new <strong>Advances</strong> <i>(Skills)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between your massive arsenal, your expert crafting, and your super abilities, you should be well-equipped for the world of battle that lies ahead, <i>hero</i>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/7e4af0d7eadac5afa121296ee4e560f9.poster.avif?t=1788199434\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/7e4af0d7eadac5afa121296ee4e560f9.webm?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/7e4af0d7eadac5afa121296ee4e560f9.mp4?t=1788199434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Highschool sophomore Jacob suddenly discovers he has super powers and must team up with his best friends to become the 'Elect Few', but convincing them to embrace their powers and save the world is all but easy. Events bring Jacob to battle villainous factions in order to bring peace to the nation.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/d19821a5041e33e54b8a9f18b6657b160f258e1d/header.jpg?t=1788199434", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/732dd803d2dc16ff40b99b9d6a70efccd3546595/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788199434", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/732dd803d2dc16ff40b99b9d6a70efccd3546595/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788199434", "website": "https://www.cytroverse.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600X 6-Core or Intel equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1080 Ti or 11GB VRAM equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 70 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not Supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Visual C++ redistributable 2022, DirectX June 2010</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 9 3950X 16-Core or Intel equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 4060 Ti or 16GB VRAM equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7